  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "真歹勢"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><b style=\"font-size: large;\">作者：</b><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>郭伊貞</b></span></p><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">無張持來到tsia</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Ji̍h電鈴huah我ê名</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">阿爸阿母人bē到聲先到</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Tshuân大包細包來　看我</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Tsit種溫情tiānn-tiānn hōo我有講bē出--來ê憂悶</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">凡勢是歡喜koh摻淡薄仔　躊躇</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">講話ē tùn-tenn koh有小可仔　大舌</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">我m̄知影ài tī佗位停睏</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Kan-na聽著家己講kah無liàn-tńg ê台語</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Pōo-pîn m̄ bat án-ne見著面suah bē-hiáu開喙</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Bē輸頭擺tsiūnn桌ê囡仔</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">濟濟mi̍h件想beh食想beh摸想beh sńg想beh講</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">M̄-koh　m̄是tsit-má</span></p><p><span></span></p><a name='more'></a><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">等到外口ê天色無聲無sueh lóng恬靜--ah</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">我tsiah發覺阿爸阿母ê白頭鬃kap jiâu痕</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">In總是無張持來就緊beh走</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Bē得tháu開ê心情koh ke一層</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">落尾tńg--去ê時親像leh講：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Kā你tsak-tsō　真歹勢</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">忽然規个人lóng gāng--去</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">聽無清楚ê話　流bē出--來ê目屎</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">熟sāi ê聲音leh講生份ê　話</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">失落ê一工</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">我夢見春風少年ê阿爸kap清秀ê阿母</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">In ê人生tsiah拄開始</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">離合悲歡ê代誌iáu未tuè--來</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Hiàng時滿天光彩　哪thang歹勢</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">　　tshia-iānn有風　哪thang歹勢</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">黃gím-gím ê花開kah規大phiàn</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">記持hiah-nī suí哪thang歹勢</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">思鄉ê浪子哪thang歹勢</span></p><div><br /></div><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<span></span></span></p><!--more--><p></p><div><br /></div><div><br /></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiGqqBEm6hzxU5rDJmkz3V56Wds29yrmyfAvWnc3_y1IMpKsFOxgTwxWJ7-7A7atSVuRAPgVxZNIBXA1JT1dXLxbpuLEpllMLt6Fz4AX_Dd2TK5wSiwZMOPSFzGFrG4uS3eKYR8FcVmiZUDEIySFDkwSinLy9jG2SR0fpc0Le11S2Fqeq_bBf6OUZcWWA/s1424/337%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiGqqBEm6hzxU5rDJmkz3V56Wds29yrmyfAvWnc3_y1IMpKsFOxgTwxWJ7-7A7atSVuRAPgVxZNIBXA1JT1dXLxbpuLEpllMLt6Fz4AX_Dd2TK5wSiwZMOPSFzGFrG4uS3eKYR8FcVmiZUDEIySFDkwSinLy9jG2SR0fpc0Le11S2Fqeq_bBf6OUZcWWA/w450-h640/337%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiNauiRcFSIGcFTzJWSo5Z8vzO1hZmDKWl6JkMqok3npjAZT9DPoWCRqnB6dLxns2vLTPv9YxgpJd4yI_1jJh-NQFp_A-v4K9tsDrDcdbxs4RmVjVk_TclBojUEh1lFcqwi4mgGMTRYxYVtYctX5wODGJUiecFH1NTAuaZh7-UNHcT63W9OinJZio868g/s4300/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1337%E6%9C%9F_%E9%BB%91%E7%